    },
    {
      "theme": "light",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<h1>“Hanabi” is an ongoing experimental project for two years which consist of both writing and photography around the theme of fireworks. For me, fireworks are beautiful in its most enigmatic way. How ephemeral yet how eternal; how unforgettable yet how repetitive. One fails to flee from the spectacle regardless. Threads of events in life are similar to the sprakling of the fire like a spoon of sugar.</h1>"
        }
      ]
    },
